DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250515
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250516
SUMMARY:Alabama: State corporate income/franchise tax return due
DESCRIPTION:Corporate due date is May 15 for calendar-year filers (one mont
 h after the federal individual due date\, not April 15)\; extension is fede
 ral extended due date plus one month. This is a filing-only extension - ful
 l tax is due by the original due date. | Corporate due date is May 15 for c
 alendar-year filers (one month after the federal individual due date\, not 
 April 15)\; extension is federal extended due date plus one month. This is 
 a filing-only extension - full tax is due by the original due date. | Autho
 rity: Direct fetch of Alabama's own tax agency site/publication this sessio
 n | Source: https://www.revenue.alabama.gov/individual-corporate/due-dates/
  | This date is computed from a recurrence rule and may not reflect a later
