 ed\, an approved federal extension automatically extends the OK due date to
  match\; otherwise Form 504-C grants an extension not exceeding 7 months to
 tal. No single fixed calendar date is stated by Oklahoma's own instructions
  - it's a floating mechanism\, not a flat date\, confirmed directly against
  the 512-Pkt and 504-C instructions. | Form 512 due 30 days after the feder
